{title: Revelation Song (Canção do Apocalipse)}
{artist: Kari Jobe}
{tempo: 136}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Verse 1}
[D9]Digno é o Cordeiro, que foi morto[Am7]
WORTHY IS THE LAMB WHO WAS SLAIN
[C9]Santo, Santo Ele é[G]
HOLY, HOLY IS HE
[D9]Um novo cântico, ao que se assenta[Am7]
A NEW SONG TO THE ONE WHO SITS
[C9]Sobre o trono do céu[G]
UPON THE THRONE OF HEAVEN

{c: Chorus}
[D9]Santo, Santo, Santo
HOLY, HOLY, HOLY
[Am7]Deus Todo Poderoso
GOD ALMIGHTY
[C9]Que era, e é, e há de vir[G]
WHO WAS AND IS AND IS TO COME
[D9]Com a criação eu canto
WITH ALL CREATION I SING
[Am7]Louvores ao Rei dos reis
PRAISES TO THE KING OF KINGS
[C9]És tudo para mim
YOU ARE EVERYTHING TO ME
[G]E eu Te adorarei
AND I WILL WORSHIP YOU

{c: Verse 2}
[D9]Está vestido, do arco-íris[Am7]
HE IS CLOTHED IN RAINBOWS
[C9]Sons de trovão, luzes, relâmpagos[G]
SOUNDS OF THUNDER, LIGHTS, LIGHTNING
[D9]Louvores, honra e glória
PRAISE, HONOR AND GLORY
[Am7]Força e poder pra sempre
STRENGTH AND POWER FOREVER
[C9]Ao único Rei eternamente[G]
TO THE ONLY KING ETERNALLY

{c: Chorus (repeat)}

{c: Verse 3}
[D9]Maravilhado, extasiado[Am7]
AMAZED, ECSTATIC
[C9]Eu fico ao ouvir Teu nome[G]
I BECOME WHEN I HEAR YOUR NAME
[D9]Jesus, Teu nome é força
JESUS, YOUR NAME IS STRENGTH
[Am7]É fôlego de vida
IT IS THE BREATH OF LIFE
[C9]Misteriosa água viva[G]
MYSTERIOUS LIVING WATER

{c: Chorus (repeat)}
